      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Lantana%2C_Texas",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The first residents moved into Lantana on July 31, 2001, marking the start of a new suburban era.",
